        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CLB150IPESBR, 1-1/2\" Diameter Ipe Wood Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunning door pull combines the warmth and beauty of dark Ipe wood with bold solid brass mounting brackets. Assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, the brackets are available in a wide array of finishes to complement both the color of the dark wood door handles and your home decor. Yes the natural color is that dark! This Beautiful Ipe Wood Door Pull is unstained. Ipe wood is a hard, heavy wood with a very tight grain. It is resistant to insects and warping, even when exposed directly to harsh weather, making it the ideal choice for exterior doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/teak-wood-door-pull-first-impressions-clb150teksbr\"><b>Teak Wood Door Handles</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CLB150IPESBR Dark Wood Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Ipe</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLB01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262230\"><b>First Impressions CLB150IPESBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CLB150018IPESBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CLB150024IPESBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CLB150IPESBR:</b>\r\n<ul>036\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
